{'symbol': 'BA', 'date': '2023-03-23 02:01:00', 'title': 'JAPAN AIRLINES SELECTS 737-8 TO GROW SUSTAINABLE WORLD-CLASS FLEET', 'text': 'SEATTLE , MARCH 23, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BOEING [NYSE:BA] AND JAPAN AIRLINES (JAL) HAVE FINALIZED AN ORDER FOR 21 SUPER-EFFICIENT 737-8 JETS. THE VERSATILE 737-8 WILL POSITION JAL TO STRENGTHEN ITS DOMESTIC AND REGIONAL NETWORK AS PASSENGER TRAFFIC CONTINUES TO RETURN TO PRE-PANDEMIC LEVELS.'}